      "widgets_values": [
        "# PART 1 - Generate a song with MiniMax Music 3\n\nThis workflow generates the song first, then creates the same timeline and prompt data used by Parts 2 and 3.\n\n**1. Write the music caption and lyrics** in the MiniMax Music 3 node. Select the three MiniMax Music model files and queue.\n\n**2. Analyse** receives the generated audio, transcribes/maps the lyrics, and divides the song into 5-10 second, beat-aware segments.\n\n**3. Review the green STOP node.** Choose a `style_preset`, add an optional `style_description`, and adjust timing if needed. The subject, locations, card prompts, and motion prompts are derived from the generated song unless you fill the optional overrides.\n\n**4. Approve and save.** `approve_timeline` marks the run you want to continue. Part 1 saves `project.json` and the generated song under:\n\n`output/storyboard_projects/<project>__<date-time>__<id>/`\n\nOpen Part 2 and keep `<< newest run >>`, or reload the browser and select this run explicitly. The saved project works with either the LTX 2.5 or MiniMax H3 Part 3 workflow."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
