      "widgets_values": [
        "# Geekatplay Studio\n### Vladimir Chopine\n\n**Thank you for your support!**\n\nIf this node pack is useful to you, please **give it a star on GitHub** - it really does help other people find it:\n\n[github.com/GeekatplayStudio/ComfyUI-Music-to-Video](https://github.com/GeekatplayStudio/ComfyUI-Music-to-Video)\n\nAnd please subscribe on YouTube for tutorials and new tools:\n\n- [youtube.com/@geekatplay](https://www.youtube.com/@geekatplay) - English\n- [youtube.com/@geekatplay-ru](https://www.youtube.com/@geekatplay-ru) - Russian\n- [youtube.com/@v-code-studio](https://www.youtube.com/@v-code-studio) - **V-Code Studio**, my new channel\n\n---\n*ComfyUI-Music-to-Video - Music Video Storyboard & Video Generator*"
      ],
      "title": "Geekatplay Studio - thank you!",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
